{"id":"b3fd272b5cf948fca7cf9b8db8693a4ffe286aa7","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1234959","title":"GPT Pro 20X，两个人用也会触发风控吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"seekinglight233","excerpt":"OpenAI - @seekinglight233 - 我们组里 6 个人，最近申请下来了三个 200 刀的额度我用 outlook 邮箱注册了三个号，现在是两个人用一个 Pro但最近频繁 Selected model is at capa","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>我们组里 6 个人，最近申请下来了三个 200 刀的额度</p>\n<p>我用 outlook 邮箱注册了三个号，现在是两个人用一个 Pro</p>\n<p>但最近频繁 Selected model is at capacity. Please try a different model</p>\n<p>尤其是上周刚重置完，几乎没法用。有没有遇到类似情况的兄弟们</p>\n</div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    <div>\n        <p><span>Supplement 1 &#160;·&#160; <span title=\"2026-08-17 14:23:28 +08:00\">11h 45m ago</span></span></p>\n        \n        <p>我刚把一个账号的邮箱换到 gmail 了，接下来几天准备做下对比实验</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    \n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/风控\"><li></li> 风控</a><a href=\"/tag/额度\"><li></li> 额度</a><a href=\"/tag/容量\"><li></li> 容量</a></P><p><span>30 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-17 23:29:07 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981716\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/516f/d93f/417579_normal.png?m=1786106139\" alt=\"dirstart\" data-uid=\"417579\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dirstart\">dirstart</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 12:42:14 +08:00\">13h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>google 表示从未遇见此问题；<br>outlook 我账号开过一次疑似降智，就没用过了==（应该还是 IP 问题）</p><p>新号比较不友好，IP 不要经常变动。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981729\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6ed4ee4dd2e384a9d8d47d2e7f43c5c4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"maolon\" data-uid=\"442547\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/maolon\">maolon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 12:45:03 +08:00\">13h 24m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>不会，你可以看我去年发的贴，和别人合用快一年了都没问题。</p><p>Selected model is at capacity.这是 gpt 他们服务器的问题，你如果不用 codex 用第三方 harness 就很容易触发这个（他们优先保证 codex 的服务），尤其是并发高的情况。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981759\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e7d1/61ac/4760_normal.png?m=1701948535\" alt=\"rails\" data-uid=\"4760\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/rails\">rails</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 12:54:08 +08:00\">13h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>最近 5.6 sol 也在报同样的错误。Selected model is at capacity. Please try a different model</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981917\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1225/df80/130038_normal.png?m=1785939786\" alt=\"VeryZero\" data-uid=\"130038\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/VeryZero\">VeryZero</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 13:32:56 +08:00\">12h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codex 是最新版本吗？之前过这个错后更新到最新版本就好了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981936\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a376/5b0b/836721_normal.png?m=1786261950\" alt=\"john1024\" data-uid=\"836721\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/john1024\">john1024</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 13:36:36 +08:00\">12h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>很有可能是算力不够，cpa 反代了一个月多了，遇到好多次了，都是官方的服务出了问题</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17982123\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/db4e11e21bcd029b51c24b84b55494be?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"lixen9\" data-uid=\"452490\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lixen9\">lixen9</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 14:03:04 +08:00\">12h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>google 号 7 、8 个人用都没出问题</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17982162\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0608228c0ce231dba7766d09cddd8df3?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"emojiiii\" data-uid=\"626698\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/emojiiii\">emojiiii</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 14:07:00 +08:00\">12h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我的 gpt pro 没试过这种情况，起码最近半个月没见过</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17982454\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/befd/b8a6/462863_normal.png?m=1766557690\" alt=\"DICK23\" data-uid=\"462863\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/DICK23\">DICK23</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 14:50:25 +08:00\">11h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>订阅没遇到过这个问题，到时中转跑的遇到过</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17982468\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3975/6000/662828_normal.png?m=1778314902\" alt=\"ktyang\" data-uid=\"662828\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ktyang\">ktyang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 14:52:43 +08:00\">11h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>outlook 邮箱是大忌啊。之前薅羊毛的时候有过一大堆，早进黑名单了。另外好奇这么多账号你们是怎么付费的呀？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17982716\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3da6/bca1/579014_normal.png?m=1655454180\" alt=\"xubeiyou\" data-uid=\"579014\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xubeiyou\">xubeiyou</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 15:39:16 +08:00\">10h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>Selected model is at capacity. Please try a different model</p><p> 这个应该是 gpt 内部问题吧？我自己一个人用的时候也遇到过的 。。。。只是一次而已  和你多人用我觉得无关的吧</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17982807\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4967ff129f13e31c80957706f945a9b0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"paieer\" data-uid=\"109640\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/paieer\">paieer</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 15:57:30 +08:00\">10h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/momo1999\">momo1999</a> 那这 5 个月内我不说了，等你 5 个月后能说出什么样的大陆文字。（世人皆欲杀，吾意独怜才）</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17982853\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/312e/8525/623670_normal.png?m=1782784578\" alt=\"codermz\" data-uid=\"623670\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/codermz\">codermz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 16:06:16 +08:00\">10h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>outlook 不敢用了,注册的 outlook 的 20x 冲